                            <comment id="16446373" author="jhonderson2007" created="Fri, 20 Apr 2018 21:11:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;the problem is on &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/40132597381c8323a265f286c3d840801347e07b/zeppelin-zengine/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/interpreter/InterpreterSetting.java#L813&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;this line&lt;/a&gt;. Only is necessary to make this change:&lt;/p&gt;

